+
+| Measure | Claude Code (Baseline → Skill Uplift) | Codex (Baseline → Skill Uplift) |
+|---|---:|---:|
+| Overall | 97.9% — baseline ran, but no comparable score was available; uplift unavailable | 80.8% — baseline ran, but no comparable score was available; uplift unavailable |
+| Security | 50.0% → 100.0% (+50.0 points) | 0.0% → 50.0% (+50.0 points) |
+| Correctness | 100.0% → 100.0% (±0.0 points) | 100.0% → 100.0% (±0.0 points) |
